                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a15278be-234f-333c-8d7a-79b01ce720dd",
                        "entry_id": "3115155e-3faf-33fc-a04d-8f90f032160f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A hairstyle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "95dce2e3-e494-4d3e-8e6d-acd5d6a40cc1",
                                "sense_id": "a15278be-234f-333c-8d7a-79b01ce720dd",
                                "text": "Just as the close, tight hairdress emphasizes and enlarges the face, so the large, loose arrangement that creates a large frame for the face makes it seem smaller by contrast ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff412df4-2113-40de-ac13-f1d100d90bb7",
                                "sense_id": "a15278be-234f-333c-8d7a-79b01ce720dd",
                                "text": "Statuette, fashioned from grayish black terracotta, depicting Princess holding flower jar; short shoulder jacket extending over free flowing robe, exposing upturned sandals; chignon hairdress; traces of red and white pigments with earthy incrustations."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29ad2c96-89e8-4562-9e21-d43d33ff035d",
                                "sense_id": "a15278be-234f-333c-8d7a-79b01ce720dd",
                                "text": "For the port, the voice, the smell, the hairdress, were seldom the same, from one day to the next, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85f407ef-4a05-44dd-89f5-7704e2cafea8",
                                "sense_id": "a15278be-234f-333c-8d7a-79b01ce720dd",
                                "text": "It is wearing an Egyptian hairdress, but no crown is distinguishable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "623697cf-ee3e-4ac9-b676-735f6097d430",
                                "sense_id": "a15278be-234f-333c-8d7a-79b01ce720dd",
                                "text": "One way to judge is to compare the hairdress of the doll under discussion with pictures of the lady at about the time the doll was made."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "411862b9-f337-346b-8e13-beab6f13a118",
                        "entry_id": "3115155e-3faf-33fc-a04d-8f90f032160f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The process or act of styling hair."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "61b4c6df-a8bb-402a-8a49-2ac3d7b65c3e",
                                "sense_id": "411862b9-f337-346b-8e13-beab6f13a118",
                                "text": "The play is laid in the period when English society paid a great deal of attention to hairdress."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fef19253-5b60-4249-b52e-3555508cdddb",
                                "sense_id": "411862b9-f337-346b-8e13-beab6f13a118",
                                "text": "In hairdress, as in clothes, do not be a slave to fashion."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbd1f263-575e-4159-97cf-08b946618eeb",
                                "sense_id": "411862b9-f337-346b-8e13-beab6f13a118",
                                "text": "Considerable attention has been given to hairdress in these, with long \"page-boy\" coiffures shown in modeling and scoring."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
